https://docs.oxide.computer/guides/key-entities-and-concepts#iam-policy

There are two parts to the Oxide IAM model:

* Identity Management: configured at the silo level for managing users and groups

* Access Management: configured at different levels of the system (fleet, silo project) to govern what each user and group can see and act on

